# Testing

- Name tests so the scenario and expected outcome are clear (e.g. `test_whenUserTapsSubmit_validatesInputBeforeSending` or `testSubmitButtonValidatesInputBeforeSending`—match existing style).
- One logical behavior per test; avoid testing multiple unrelated things.
- Use the project's mocking/faking approach (e.g. protocol-based fakes, not necessarily a specific framework).
- Prefer testing behavior and outcomes over implementation details; avoid brittle assertions on private state.
